body.div:
-1 if this node precedes the other node, +1 if it follows the other
         node, or 0 if they are the same node. (In this case, isSameNode() will always
         return true, and the two nodes will produce the same result for generateId())

net.sf.saxon.om.AxisInfo#PRECEDING if this node is on the preceding axis of the other node;
         net.sf.saxon.om.AxisInfo#FOLLOWING if it is on the following axis; net.sf.saxon.om.AxisInfo#ANCESTOR if the first node is an
         ancestor of the second; net.sf.saxon.om.AxisInfo#DESCENDANT if the first is a descendant of the second;
         net.sf.saxon.om.AxisInfo#SELF if they are the same node.

